     "*   **Volume Texture:** Stores the SDF values.",
     "**Load Mesh:** Load the mesh file into a `MeshSDF` object or equivalent structure.",
     "The core of the method is computing the distance from a point $p$ to the mesh.",
     "**Triangle Distance:** For a triangle with vertices $v_0, v_1, v_2$, let $\\mathbf{e1} = v_1 - v_0$ and $\\mathbf{e2} = v_2 - v_0$.",
     "where $\\mathbf{pa} = p - v_0$ and $\\mathbf{ba} = v_0 - v_1$.",
     "If outside the triangle's projection, $d = \\|\\mathbf{proj}\\|$.",
     "If $|det| < 10^{-8}$, the ray is parallel.",
     "*   **Ray Casting:** Cast a ray from $p$ along an axis.",
     "*   **Thin Surfaces:** Thin surfaces can only be expressed using negative texels inside the mesh to find the root.",
     "*   **Time Complexity:** $O(V \\cdot N)$, where $V$ is the number of voxels and $N$ is the number of triangles.",
     "*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(V)$, where $V = res^3$."
    ]
